    </div>
    <p><br></p>
    <h3 id=3D"PRDFeatureLifecycleManagement-CurrentFeatureRegistrationFlow"=
>Current Feature Registration Flow</h3>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width=
: 98.075%;">
      <colgroup>
       <col style=3D"width: 7.15047%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 17.8869%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 17.4959%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 18.2707%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 18.368%;">
       <col style=3D"width: 20.828%;">
      </colgroup>
      <tbody>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh"><br></th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Create Feature in Resource=
s Inventory =E2=86=92</th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Feature List Update =E2=86=92</th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Feature Packaging &nbsp;=
=E2=86=92</th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Feature Permissioning =E2=
=86=92</th>
        <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Platform UI Updates</th>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">Goal</th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Features must be registered as resources=
 so that those resources are available for consumption on the platform</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Make feature inventory visible for furth=
er configuration of its behavior on the platform</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Enable firm and user assignment of new r=
esources</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Ensure feature permissions can be enforc=
ed when assigned to firm &amp; user.</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Ensure new features appear properly and =
consistently across all consuming tools</td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">Steps</th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"e448cd9c-938d-4ac9-b882-ccec5a85584c">Register M=
enu resources to define a new Module (i.e. left nav.) and allow for this mo=
dule to show up in Firm and User Settings</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"afa7690b-5e71-4c74-b84c-f170535e710f">Register P=
ermission resources for use in ...&nbsp;</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">N/A - manually populated in the new Feat=
ure List tool and does not connect to feature inventory</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"dfb93777-8706-45ee-b7da-bb81c72b888f"><span>Defi=
ne what scopes are needed to access the APIs in the feature, and then updat=
e the user groups in okta</span></li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">Firm Settings</span></p>
         <p>User Settings</p>
         <p>Navigation</p>
         <p>System Health Status Management</p>
         <p>Unified Access Request</p></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">
         <p>Details</p></th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>Basic resources for any application</p>
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"be33b2a2-18ed-42ce-a678-436961dc26a8">Menu resou=
rces=20
           <ul>
            <li>Menu resource ( Mandatory )</li>
            <li>Restriction resource</li>
           </ul></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"4d26baf8-597b-4313-9666-c088cf8dd628">Permission=
 Resources=20
           <ul>
            <li>View resource=20
             <ul>
              <li>mainly displayed in -&gt; Firm Settings</li>
             </ul></li>
            <li>Manage, Control, Process etc.&nbsp;=20
             <ul>
              <li>Displayed in firm settlings and distributed across the va=
rious user packages as needed ( made optional if it's a user package where =
the feature can be assigned as an add-on</li>
             </ul></li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul>
         <p>Resource definition includes</p>
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"65759226-bfd7-4a0f-8d95-742a1373e66f">Type</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"41f55b2c-f4b7-4f9d-b526-948e651f403d">Restrictio=
n</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"a7a3dd18-6f32-4332-b0e3-16585f6977c6">Group</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"5093f260-c8d1-4cb9-8e9b-131c8552e542">Level</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"a02b9ebc-90b2-4fe3-b7a6-8f9ea923e49b">Assignment=
 Mode (mandatory or optional)</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"3fb87ce0-d265-452b-bd4e-681dce3453c1">Override (=
default to on/off on restricted resources)</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p><br></p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>Firm Package Registration</p>
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"27d2012d-ecef-460b-918e-8cbca741c808">Menu Resou=
rce Assignment=20
           <ul>
            <li>Menu ( Always registered Selected and Mandatory )</li>
            <li>Restriction ( Always registered Not Selected and Optional )=
=20
             <ul>
              <li>Tag with moduleOverride: True -&gt; makes the hide button=
 show up</li>
             </ul></li>
           </ul></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"63735847-dacc-48b6-9144-e46a06d3785b">Permission=
 Resource Assignment=20
           <ul>
            <li>View ( Selected and Mandatory )</li>
            <li>Manage, Control, Process ( Always Selected and Mandatory at=
 the firm level )</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul>
         <p><span style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0px;">User Package Registratio=
n</span></p>
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"481edacc-3e79-4550-ad0f-8c3e1aff7523">Menu Regis=
tration=20
           <ul>
            <li>Menu ( Selected and Mandatory )</li>
            <li>Restricted ( Not selected and Optional )=20
             <ul>
              <li>Tag with moduleOverride: True - make the restriction unch=
ecked by default</li>
             </ul></li>
           </ul></li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"8abe3ffd-160f-427e-ba7a-f9b4d99131cc">Permission=
 Registration=20
           <ul>
            <li>View ( Selected and Mandatory always)</li>
            <li>Manage, Control, Process ( Selected and Mandatory in the ap=
propriate user packages, optional when the user needs to select such as tra=
ding products or drop approval )</li>
           </ul></li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p><br></p></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <p>What are the content API</p>
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"f5fe1328-347c-4286-b89d-00aed7555fab">Group Labe=
l</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"50b2310a-78eb-497d-8594-40e2c1ac3d5d">Resource L=
abel</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"4fea8e0b-a53f-465b-8f27-9bd2bcdc8ab0">View Resou=
rce Label</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"3f0ebd13-9fb8-467c-98ed-79c7a1008ad1">View Resou=
rce Description</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"4d61ec14-cfd3-47dd-b154-e47b9550616e">Nav Link L=
abel</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
       <tr>
        <th scope=3D"row" class=3D"confluenceTh">Notes / limitations</th>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"5305b301-692a-42ca-b8cb-f85f6045a864">No concept=
 of "Features" - Resource Group used as a facsimile</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"e81346c8-95c1-4034-85e1-79cb9a1e0d5b">Disconnect=
ed from upstream step</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"8c73771b-d0ed-406b-a758-7bca3543d338">Currently =
adds a step to enable Sys Health Status and possibly UAR</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"689b25e6-80d3-4253-8bbf-74ee00df5048">Feature at=
tributes are not being used?</li>
         </ul></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
       </tr>
      </tbody>
     </table>
    </div>
    <p><br></p>
    <p><br></p>
    <p><br></p>
    <p><br></p>
    <p><br></p>
    <p><br></p>
    <h2 id=3D"PRDFeatureLifecycleManagement-OperationalImpact&amp;Considera=
tions">Operational Impact &amp; Considerations</h2>
    <div role=3D"region" aria-label=3D"Info" class=3D"confluence-informatio=
n-macro  confluence-information-macro-information">
     <span role=3D"presentation" class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconf=
ont-info-filled confluence-information-macro-icon"></span>
     <div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"f7ae38f1-6b01-44ea-a299-41d0f0af54ad">Describe how =
this feature may impact our teams</li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"061db033-d9f5-43ce-8c3c-d2683cef8f70">Describe depe=
ndencies across other products/initiatives/features/launches</li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"4efe7aa4-a4f9-4dc2-a4ee-5ef8a91e3b1e">Be specific a=
bout current vs. new workflows, procedures,</li>
      </ul>
     </div>
    </div>
    <p><br></p>
    <h1 id=3D"PRDFeatureLifecycleManagement-FeatureDistribution"><span>Feat=
ure Distribution</span></h1>
    <div role=3D"region" aria-label=3D"Note" class=3D"confluence-informatio=
n-macro  confluence-information-macro-note">
     <span role=3D"presentation" class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconf=
ont-warning confluence-information-macro-icon"></span>
     <div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
      <p><span>Draft as inputs into feature onboarding &amp; feature activa=
tion planning, lock down once onboarding / activation planning is kicked of=
f in order to finalize any last requirements such as integration / activati=
on controls that feed into delivery refinement.<br></span></p>
     </div>
    </div>
    <h2 id=3D"PRDFeatureLifecycleManagement-FeatureAssignment">Feature Assi=
gnment</h2>
    <h3 id=3D"PRDFeatureLifecycleManagement-CapabilityMapping">Capability M=
apping</h3>
    <div role=3D"region" aria-label=3D"Info" class=3D"confluence-informatio=
n-macro  confluence-information-macro-information">
     <span role=3D"presentation" class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconf=
ont-info-filled confluence-information-macro-icon"></span>
     <div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"f5d0b9b7-cc9f-49c7-8567-47d79d36da46">Where does it=
 fit into our <a href=3D"https://wiki.bnc.ca/display/COMPASS/NBIN+Digital+C=
apabilities" rel=3D"nofollow">NBIN Digital Capabilities Map</a>?</li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"e6faa7e5-b93e-4aed-82be-db983dcb5c49">What are the =
available functions: View / Manage / Control / Processing with possible int=
ervention?</li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"444951df-8938-4ae6-ac8e-f1c376dba862">Is this a cor=
e capability or non-core?</li>
      </ul>
     </div>
    </div>
    <p><br></p>
    <h3 id=3D"PRDFeatureLifecycleManagement-FeaturePackaging&amp;Assignment=
">Feature Packaging &amp; Assignment</h3>
    <div role=3D"region" aria-label=3D"Info" class=3D"confluence-informatio=
n-macro  confluence-information-macro-information">
     <span role=3D"presentation" class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconf=
ont-info-filled confluence-information-macro-icon"></span>
     <div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
      <p>Describe who this app is intended for, e.g.:</p>
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"62def81e-596a-4b13-b50c-a26ef34dbf01">Is it for all=
 firms as part of our core offering, or a separate add-on?</li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"d76e6209-2794-4104-92f2-38c81e211616">Is it only av=
ailable for certain types of firms?</li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"e01c5f27-1364-48ae-91b0-29564ad26507">Is this featu=
re automatically packaged together within an app or separately assignable?&=
nbsp; What is the rationale?&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>
      </ul>
     </div>
    </div>
    <p><br></p>
    <p><strong>Firm-level Assignment</strong></p>
    <p><br></p>
    <p><strong>User-level Assignment</strong></p>
    <p><br></p>
    <h2 id=3D"PRDFeatureLifecycleManagement-FeatureRoll-OutPlan">Feature Ro=
ll-Out Plan</h2>
    <div role=3D"region" aria-label=3D"Info" class=3D"confluence-informatio=
n-macro  confluence-information-macro-information">
     <span role=3D"presentation" class=3D"aui-icon aui-icon-small aui-iconf=
ont-info-filled confluence-information-macro-icon"></span>
     <div class=3D"confluence-information-macro-body">
      <p>PM is responsible for defining what validation steps are required =
to fully launch the product(s), target product readiness and validation per=
iods required.&nbsp; This is based on PM risk assessment on the path to ado=
ption.</p>
      <p>&nbsp;This section drives GTM planning and product activation.</p>
      <p>&nbsp;Roll-out planning:</p>
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"f7084060-777b-4102-80d3-cd6aeffe30b3">Does this fea=
ture require incremental validation (e.g. alpha / beta / pilot / GA) and wh=
y?</li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"abf13977-26c9-4159-8288-c82145d6baba">Is there a de=
commissioning component after a certain time or as of GA?</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Change management &amp; activation planning:</p>
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"fd90d10f-0504-40e5-baf6-bbe76272a04c">For new versi=
on (replacement of an existing version, or legacy version), describe the tr=
ansition experience for the user:</li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"ba2a37a9-a983-4fbc-bca9-10e4509b007f">Where do they=
 go today for the feature?</li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"7763d980-6c71-46b3-a0f1-9de4b115d4a0">How will they=
 get to the new version of the feature?</li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"6630a2ec-ba73-43ef-a4a8-883a7c57994f">Will both ver=
sions of the feature be accessible to the user?&nbsp; If so, why and what i=
s the time period?</li>
       <li data-uuid=3D"ed75d9ac-318d-4130-971c-89639a448f39">Is there a ch=
ange in the functionality of the new version, that expands what a user can =
do (i.e. have an impact on access controls?)</li>
      </ul>
      <p>For net new features:</p>
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"6a3814fb-0d18-483f-95da-e62d5d049828">Will the roll=
-out be done in stages, or launched to all firms &amp; users at once?</li>
      </ul>
     </div>
    </div>
    <p><br></p>
    <p>e.g.</p>
    <div class=3D"table-wrap">
     <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width=
: 91.9363%;">
      <colgroup class=3D"">
       <col class=3D"" style=3D"width: 11.4465%;">
       <col class=3D"" style=3D"width: 9.61994%;">
       <col class=3D"" style=3D"width: 9.74171%;">
       <col class=3D"" style=3D"width: 10.5941%;">
       <col class=3D"" style=3D"width: 12.2989%;">
       <col class=3D"" style=3D"width: 46.2681%;">
      </colgroup>
      <tbody class=3D"">
       <tr class=3D"">
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Product</th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Alpha</th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Beta</th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Pilot</th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">GA</th>
        <th class=3D"confluenceTh">Activation / Deactivation&nbsp;Notes</th=
>
       </tr>
       <tr class=3D"">
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">GIC</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">:tick:&nbsp; Nov-Jan</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">:cross:&nbsp;</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">:tick: TBC</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">:tick: phasing TBC</td>
        <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
         <ul>
          <li data-uuid=3D"edc55c5e-1ef8-47f8-b8ae-27a9161b8542">Replaces t=
he current iMOST GIC instruction</li>
          <li data-uuid=3D"392ec54d-0424-4521-8e25-72102fdd63ba">Requires s=
hut down of the old instruction as firms are transitioned to avoid dual ope=
rational processing</li>
         </ul></td>
       </tr>
      </tbody>
     </table>
    </div>
    <p><br></p>
    <h2 id=3D"PRDFeatureLifecycleManagement-RelatedRequirements">Related Re=
quirements</h2>
    <p>Add a link to the feature onboarding plan managed by Platform Team.<=
/p>
    <p>&nbsp;Add a link to GTM plan managed by the Launch team.</p>
   </div>
  </div>
 </div>
</div>
    </div>
